# Paths that must never be committed to or pushed from this repository. Checked by scripts/dev/forbidden-paths.sh from
# the .githooks/ hooks and the leak-guard workflow, on top of its built-in list (env files, keys, signing material,
# .xcarchive/.ipa, local Claude settings).
#
# One glob per line. A glob without "/" matches the file name at any depth; a glob with "/" matches the whole path from
# the repository root. "*" also matches "/", and matching ignores case. "!glob" exempts a path that a deny glob matched.
#
# Internal documents live in the private repository DyorHQ/internal (under ios-app/), never here: audit reports and
# checklists, security reviews, runbooks and owner procedures, handoffs, incident and relaunch notes, plans and decision
# logs. docs/ keeps only its README and the developer docs exempted at the end.

# Secrets and credentials beyond the built-in list
.envrc
.netrc
.pgpass
*.secret
secrets.json
secrets.yml
secrets.yaml
credentials.json
service-account*.json
.foundry/*

# Deployment output and logs (forge's cache/ keeps RPC URLs; logs can hold anything a script printed)
contracts/broadcast/*
contracts/cache/*
*.log
.wrangler/*

# Local AI-session files
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/projects/*
.claude/shell-snapshots/*
.claude/todos/*
*/.claude/*.local.*

# Internal documents
HANDOFF*
*RUNBOOK*
*security-audit*
*security-audit*/*
*security-review*
*security-review*/*
*-audit-*/*
*audit*/REPORT*
*audit*/FIXES*
*audit*/CHECKLIST*
*audit*report*
*pentest*
*postmortem*
*post-mortem*
*incident*.md
*relaunch*.md
*redeploy*.md
*decisions*.md
*decision-log*
*readiness-review*
*checklist*.md
*-plan.md
*_plan.md
plan.md
docs/*
ios/docs/*
!docs/README.md
!docs/app-wiring.md
!docs/swap-spec.md
